4 Charges and the click made 6 and the click's op landed a tick late. Beside
the knight's footprint the click now goes route:false (the OPNPC alone, one
event); when the client refuses it (not_in_reach) the routed click goes out
the same tick. Elsewhere it stays routed.

pickpocket.test.ts: the fake answers as the browser client (a routed action
reports its user events), the stun pack's biggest tick is pinned at 5 events
with overBudget 0, and the default-identical golden hashes the trace without
the route flag, pinned separately.
